ield" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf"} {"question" "q-20361" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-20361" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -6\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 5 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 6\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-20361" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129132" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7 & -4 & 0 & 9 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -4 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129132" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+0z=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129132" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf"} {"question" "q-129132" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129132" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\begin{aligned}7x+4y=9 \\\\ 3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x+4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+9z=0 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}