"file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-20363" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x+2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+0y+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y+0z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain: \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-20363" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf"} {"question" "q-20363" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-20363" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ x-3y=3\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}2y-3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+y=3\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x-3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-20363" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-20362" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-20362" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1e