 the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & -3 & -15\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\begin{aligned}-5x-y=10 \\\\ -3x-2y=-5\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=1 \\\\ -2x-3y=-5\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ 2x-3y=-16\\end{aligned}"] ["math" "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ 2x-3y=-18\\end{aligned}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-71728" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129146" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n=11 \\\\ 0=4n-8 \\\\ n=-6m+\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129146" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $m,n$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n=11 \\\\ 0m-4n=-8 \\\\ 6m+n=\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129146" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf"} {"question" "q-129146" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129146" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & -6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & -1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & 6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129146" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-71733" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=-5 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-71733" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-71733" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf"} {"question" "q-71733" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-fiel