right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}a-4b-c=0 \\\\ -11a+0b+3c=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-1073" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "58a528cff20e81240a29618a2501db1a7e744090acb230fd24881e525813dbbf"} {"question" "q-1073" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-1073" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ -3 & -11 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -11 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-1073" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129144" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a=6b \\\\ 2a-7b=5 \\\\ 2a-4b+\\frac{3}{2}=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954b9a5ded7ad10b4860eb090b9606830dba635ffab95479"} {"question" "q-129144" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a-6b=0 \\\\ 2a-7b=5 \\\\ 2a-4b=-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 \\\\ 2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035972/state.json" "file_sha256" "ec6b1bb1ec5a1ac5954